('fae50c67-a087-5c70-a051-d133b92fb062', '8695e833-9d29-4367-bfd6-0c20aebb2b1d', '2df83c3e-834f-517a-a55c-cf1ff80eccfb', 'a-level', '31.3', '9702 coursebook 31.3 · Stellar radii: Wien and Stefan–Boltzmann', 26, 26, 'A star has a luminosity of 1.5 × 10²⁸ W and a surface temperature of 9500 K. Calculate its radius, in units of 10⁹ m. Take σ = 5.67 × 10⁻⁸ W m⁻² K⁻⁴.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '1.608', '10⁹ m', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'r = √(L/4πσT⁴) = √(1.5 × 10²⁸ ÷ (4π × 5.67 × 10⁻⁸ × 9500⁴)) = 1.61 × 10⁹ m. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: rearranged. C1: substitution. A1: r = 1.61 × 10⁹ m.', 3, NULL, NULL),
('e5315a37-73a2-5ada-8d0a-40646e52ba91', '8695e833-9d29-4367-bfd6-0c20aebb2b1d', '2df83c3e-834f-517a-a55c-cf1ff80eccfb', 'a-level', '31.3', '9702 coursebook 31.3 · Stellar radii: Wien and Stefan–Boltzmann', 27, 27, 'A star''s spectrum peaks at 450 nm and its luminosity is 2.0 × 10²⁷ W. Calculate its radius, in units of 10⁹ m. Take the Wien constant = 2.90 × 10⁻³ m K and σ = 5.67 × 10⁻⁸ W m⁻² K⁻⁴.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '1.276', '10⁹ m', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'T = 2.90 × 10⁻³ ÷ 450 × 10⁻⁹ = 6444 K. r = √(2.0 × 10²⁷ ÷ (4π × 5.67 × 10⁻⁸ × (6444)⁴)) = 1.28 × 10⁹ m. Mark scheme (4 marks). C1: T from Wien. C1: Stefan–Boltzmann rearranged. C1: value. A1: r = 1.28 × 10⁹ m.', 4, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 420 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fgd7877029-t fgd7877029-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fgd7877029-t">Stellar spectrum</title><desc id="fgd7877029-d">Black-body spectrum of a star: relative intensity against wavelength from 0 to 2000 nm, peaking at 450 nm.</desc><line x1="24" y1="34" x2="24" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="118.5" y1="34" x2="118.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="213" y1="34" x2="213" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="307.5" y1="34" x2="307.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="402" y1="34" x2="402" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="24" y1="242" x2="402" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;st