('73a2d391-b064-52af-9a4e-687298f7e5ea', 'ec57f1f6-74c8-5663-b896-6aff2ba2439c', 'Its luminosity (from flux and distance) and its temperature (from Wien''s law) give r through L = 4πr²σT⁴', 'D', true, 3),
