t-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">4</text><line x1="242.4" y1="242" x2="242.4" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="242.4" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">6</text><line x1="312.2" y1="242" x2="312.2" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="312.2" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">8</text><line x1="382" y1="242" x2="382" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="382" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">10</text><line x1="29" y1="242" x2="33" y2="242" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="26" y="242" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0</text><line x1="29" y1="200.4" x2="33" y2="200.4" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="26" y="200.4" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0.5</text><line x1="29" y1="158.8" x2="33" y2="158.8" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="26" y="158.8" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">1.0</text><line x1="29" y1="117.2" x2="33" y2="117.2" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="26" y="117.2" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">1.5</text><line x1="29" y1="75.6" x2="33" y2="75.6" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="26" y="75.6" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">2.0</text><line x1="29" y1="34" x2="33" y2="34" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="26" y="34" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">2.5</text><text x="207.5" y="274" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">distance d / 10²⁴ m</text><text x="29" y="14" font-size="14" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">recession speed v / 10⁷ m s⁻¹</text><polyline points="33,242 382,57.1" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:6 4"/><polyline points="33,75.6 347.1,75.6" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:3 3"/><polyline points="347.1,242 347.1,75.6" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:3 3"/><line x1="343.1" y1="71.6" x2="351.1" y2="79.6" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="343.1" y1="79.6" x2="351.1" y2="71.6" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/></svg>', 'A galaxy plotted at distance 9.0 × 10²⁴ m and recession speed 2.0 × 10⁷ m s⁻¹, on a line through the origin.'),
('9dd85696-bfa8-52dc-af62-d7f5fa2644d9', '8695e833-9d29-4367-bfd6-0c20aebb2b1d', '397b2565-7a2c-5e16-a138-021d30b81dd9', 'a-level', '31.4', '9702 coursebook 31.4 · Hubble’s law and the Big Bang', 36, 36, 'Taking H₀ = 70 km s⁻¹ Mpc⁻¹, calculate the recession speed of a galaxy 50 Mpc away, in km s⁻¹.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '3500', 'km s⁻¹', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'v = 70 × 50 = 3500 km s⁻¹. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: v = H₀d. C1: units. A1: v = 3500 km s⁻¹.', 3, NULL, NULL),
('2034c76c-8913-5be9-b612-ccc77c5a14a8', '8695e833-9d29-4367-bfd6-0c20aebb2b1d', '397b2565-7a2c-5e16-a138-021d30b81dd9', 'a-level', '31.4', '9702 coursebook 31.4 · Hubble’s law and the Big Bang', 37, 37, 'How would a larger value of H₀ affect the estimated age of the Universe?', NULL, 2, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'The age would be smaller, since T ≈ 1/H₀', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Faster expansion means less time to reach present distances. Mark scheme (4 marks). C1: T ∝ 1/H₀. C1: younger. C1: assumption of constant rate. A1: B (The age would be smaller, since T ≈ 1/H₀).', 4, NULL, NULL),
('7ecf3214-ea36-5953-b06e-f29f3faec290', '8695e833-9d29-4367-bfd6-0c20aebb2b1d', '397b2565-7a2c-5e16-a138-021d30b81dd9', 'a-level', '31.4', '9702 coursebook 31.4 · Hubble’s law and the Big Bang', 38, 38, 'A calcium line at 397 nm is observed at 401 nm from a galaxy. Calculate its recession speed in km s⁻¹. Take c = 3.00 × 10⁸ m s⁻¹.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '3023', 'km s⁻¹', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'v = 3.00 × 10⁸ × 4 ÷ 397 = 3.023 × 10⁶ m s⁻¹. In km s⁻¹: 3.023 × 10⁶ ÷ 10³ = 3020. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: Δλ/λ = v/c. C1: m to km. A1: v = 3020 km s⁻¹.', 3, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 460 214" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg829b3a4f-t fg829b3a4f-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg829b3a4f-t">Redshifted calcium line</title><desc id="fg829b3a4f-d">A calcium line at 397 nm in the laboratory spectrum appears at 401 nm in the spectrum of a galaxy.</desc><rect x="104" y="34" width="332" height="32" rx="0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="94" y="50" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">laboratory</text><rect x="104" y="106" width="332" height="32" rx="0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="94" y="122" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">galaxy</text><line x1="245.1" y1="34" x2="245.1" y2="66" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.6;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="245.1" y="22" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">397 nm</text><line x1="278.3" y1="106" x2="278.3" y2="138" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.6;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="278.3" y="151" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">401 nm</text><line x1="245.1" y1="66" x2="278.3" y2="106" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:4 3"/><line x1="104" y1="168" x2="436" y2="168" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="104" y1="168" x2="104" y2="173" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="104" y="184" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">380</text><line x1="187" y1="168" x2="187" y2="173" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="187" y="184" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">390</text><line x1="270" y1="168" x2="270" y2="173" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="270" y="184" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">400</text><line x1="353" y1="168" x2="353" y2="173" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="353" y="184" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">410</text><line x1="436" y1="168" x2="436" y2="173" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="436" y="184" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">420</text><text x="270" y="206" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">wavelength / nm</text></svg>', 'A calcium line at 397 nm in the laboratory spectrum appears at 401 nm in the spectrum of a galaxy.'),
('bdab0e2d-574b-57fa-a3de-15464186bbcd', '8695e833-9d29-4367-bfd6-0c20aebb2b1d', '397b2565-7a2c-5e16-a138-021d30b81dd9', 'a-level', '31.4', '9702 coursebook 31.4 · Hubble’s law and the Big Bang', 39, 39, 'The age of the Universe is estimated as 1/H₀ with H₀ = 2.2 × 10⁻¹⁸ s⁻¹. Calculate the age in seconds, in units of 10¹⁷ s.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '4.545', '10¹⁷ s', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'T = 1 ÷ 2.2 × 10⁻¹⁸ = 4.55 × 10¹⁷ s. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: T = 1/H₀. C1: value. A1: T = 4.55 × 10¹⁷ s.', 3, NULL, NULL),
('783c0a36-e5e4-5cdb-9f9f-c6442cb5885a', '8695e833-9d29-4367-bfd6-0c20aebb2b1d', '397b2565-7a2c-5e16-a138-021d30b81dd9', 'a-level', '31.4', '9702 coursebook 31.4 · Hubble’s law and the Big Bang', 40, 40, 'Two galaxies show redshifts Δλ/λ of 0.010 and 0.030. What does this show about their distances, according to Hubble''s law?', NULL, 2, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'The second is about three times as far away', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Δλ/λ = v/c, so v ∝ Δλ/λ; Hubble: d = v/H₀, so the distance ratio is 0.030 ÷ 0.010 = 3. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: v ∝ z. C1: d ∝ v. A1: C (The second is about three times as far away).', 3, NULL, NULL),
('339a5cdb-d13c-5984-b4fb-cfce74d3ac20', '8695e833-9d29-4367-bfd6-0c20aebb2b1d', '397b2565-7a2c-5e16-a138-021d30b81dd9', 'a-level', '31.4', '9702 coursebook 31.4 · Hubble’s law and the Big Bang', 41, 41, 'A galaxy is 1.5 × 10²⁵ m away. Taking H₀ = 2.3 × 10⁻¹⁸ s⁻¹, calculate the observed wavelength of a line emitted at 500 nm. Take c = 3.00 × 10⁸ m s⁻¹.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '557.5 nm', 'nm', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'v = 2.3 × 10⁻¹⁸ × 1.5 × 10²⁵ = 3.45 × 10⁷ m s⁻¹. λ = 500 × (1 + 3.45 × 10⁷ ÷ 3.00 × 10⁸) = 558 nm. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: v = H₀d. C1: λ(1 + v/c). A1: λ = 558 nm.', 3, NULL, NULL),
('bc8c8f95-6465-52e2-a1ae-d9c49e2d9a67', '8695e833-9d29-4367-bfd6-0c20aebb2b1d', '397b2565-7a2c-5e16-a138-021d30b81dd9', 'a-level', '31.4', '9702 coursebook 31.4 · Hubble’s law and the Big Bang', 42, 42, 'A galaxy is 120 Mpc away. Taking H₀ = 70 km s⁻¹ Mpc⁻¹, calculate the shift Δλ of a hydrogen line emitted at 656 nm, in nm. Take c = 3.00 × 10⁸ m s⁻¹.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '18.37 nm', 'nm', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'v = H₀d = 70 × 120 = 8400 km s⁻¹. Δλ = λv/c = 656 × 8400 ÷ 3.00 × 10⁵ = 18.4 nm. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: v = H₀d. C1: Δλ = λv/c. A1: Δλ = 18.4 nm.', 3, NULL, NULL),
('c933df1f-719b-5be2-9ece-bf87ab65a136', '8695e833-9d29-4367-bfd6-0c20aebb2b1d', '397b2565-7a2c-5e16-a138-021d30b81dd9', 'a-level', '31.4', '9702 coursebook 31.4 · Hubble’s law and the Big Bang', 43, 43, 'The light from a galaxy has Δλ/λ = 0.042. Taking H₀ = 70 km s⁻¹ Mpc⁻¹, calculate the distance of the galaxy in Mpc. Take c = 3.00 × 10⁸ m s⁻¹.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '180', 'Mpc', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'v = 0.042 × 3.00 × 10⁵ = 1.26 × 10⁴ km s⁻¹. d = v/H₀ = 1.26 × 10⁴ ÷ 70 = 180 Mpc. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: v = cΔλ/λ. C1: d = v/H₀. A1: d = 180 Mpc.', 3, NULL, NULL),
('b152a68a-caf3-5358-a9ca-bd70c601e7be', '8695e833-9d29-4367-bfd6-0c20aebb2b1d', '397b2565-7a2c-5e16-a138-021d30b81dd9', 'a-level', '31.4', '9702 coursebook 31.4 · Hubble’s law and the Big Bang', 44, 44, 'A galaxy 4.0 × 10²⁴ m away recedes at 9.2 × 10⁶ m s⁻¹. Use these values to estimate the age of the Universe, in units of 10¹⁰ years (1 year = 3.16 × 10⁷ s).', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '1.376', '10¹⁰ years', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'T = d/v = 4.0 × 10²⁴ ÷ 9.2 × 10⁶ = 4.348 × 10¹⁷ s, which is 4.348 × 10¹⁷ ÷ 3.16 × 10⁷ = 1.38 × 10¹⁰ years. Mark scheme (4 marks). M1: T = d/v = 1/H₀. C1: value in s. C1: years. A1: T = 1.38 × 10¹⁰ years.', 4, NULL, NULL),
('66a4f880-cf79-5bfd-819e-832db3d844a4', '8695e833-9d29-4367-bfd6-0c20aebb2b1d', '397b2565-7a2c-5e16-a138-021d30b81dd9', 'a-level', '31.4', '9702 coursebook 31.4 · Hubble’s law and the Big Bang', 45, 45, 'Light from a galaxy contains a hydrogen line at 691 nm; the laboratory wavelength is 656 nm. (a) Calculate the recession speed. (b) Calculate the distance using H₀ = 2.3 × 10⁻¹⁸ s⁻¹. (c) Express it in Mpc (1 Mpc = 3.09 × 10²² m). Give only the answer to (c). Take c = 3.00 × 10⁸ m s⁻¹.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '225.2', 'Mpc', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) v = 3.00 × 10⁸ × 35 ÷ 656 = 1.601 × 10⁷ m s⁻¹. (b) d = 1.601 × 10⁷ ÷ 2.3 × 10⁻¹⁸ = 6.959 × 10²⁴ m. (c) 6.959 × 10²⁴ ÷ 3.09 × 10²² = 225 Mpc. Mark scheme (6 marks). C1: v. C1: d = v/H₀. C1: value in m. M1: m to Mpc. C1: value. A1: d = 225 Mpc.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 460 214" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg355de11e-t fg355de11e-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg355de11e-t">Redshifted hydrogen line</title><desc id="fg355de11e-d">A hydrogen line at 656 nm in the laboratory spectrum appears at 691 nm in the spectrum of a galaxy.</desc><rect x="104" y="34" width="332" height="32" rx="0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="94" y="50" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">laboratory</text><rect x="104" y="106" width="332" height="32" rx="0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="94" y="122" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">galaxy</text><line x1="223.5" y1="34" x2="223.5" y2="66" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.6;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="223.5" y="22" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">656 nm</text><line x1="339.7" y1="106" x2="339.7" y2="138" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.6;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="339.7" y="151" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">691 nm</text><line x1="223.5" y1="66" x2="339.7" y2="106" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:4 3"/><line x1="104" y1="168" x2="436" y2="168" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="104" y1="168" x2="104" y2="173" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="104" y="184" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">620</text><line x1="170.4" y1="168" x2="170.4" y2="173" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="170.4" y="184" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">640</text><line x1="236.8" y1="168" x2="236.8" y2="173" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="236.8" y="184" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">660</text><line x1="303.2" y1="168" x2="303.2" y2="173" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="303.2" y="184" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">680</text><line x1="369.6" y1="168" x2="369.6" y2="173" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="369.6" y="184" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">700</text><line x1="436" y1="168" x2="436" y2="173" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="436" y="184" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">720</text><text x="270" y="206" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">wavelength / nm</text></svg>', 'A hydrogen line at 656 nm in the laboratory spectrum appears at 691 nm in the spectrum of a galaxy.'),
('fe98432e-936f-56bb-bd90-a20c46246c70', '8695e833-9d29-4367-bfd6-0c20aebb2b1d', '397b2565-7a2c-5e16-a138-021d30b81dd9', 'a-level', '31.4', '9702 coursebook 31.4 · Hubble’s law and the Big Bang', 46, 46, 'A type 1a supernova of luminosity 1.0 × 10³⁶ W in a galaxy gives a flux of 1.0 × 10⁻¹⁵ W m⁻². The galaxy recedes at 6.5 × 10⁶ m s⁻¹. (a) Calculate the distance. (b) Calculate H₀ from this galaxy, in units of 10⁻¹⁸ s⁻¹.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '0.7286', '10⁻¹⁸ s⁻¹', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) d = √(1.0 × 10³⁶ ÷ (4π × 1.0 × 10⁻¹⁵)) = 8.921 × 10²⁴ m. (b) H₀ = 6.5 × 10⁶ ÷ 8.921 × 10²⁴ = 7.29 × 10⁻¹⁹ s⁻¹. Mark scheme (5 marks). C1: d from standard candle. C1: value. M1: H₀ = v/d. C1: value. A1: H₀ = 0.729 × 10⁻¹⁸ s⁻¹.', 5, NULL, NULL),
('aadc908c-bc31-5e0a-a226-8fce4d2af427', '8695e833-9d29-4367-bfd6-0c20aebb2b1d', '397b2565-7a2c-5e16-a138-021d30b81dd9', 'a-level', '31.4', '9702 coursebook 31.4 · Hubble’s law and the Big Bang', 47, 47, 'Taking H₀ = 70 km s⁻¹ Mpc⁻¹ (1 Mpc = 3.09 × 10²² m, 1 year = 3.16 × 10⁷ s): (a) convert H₀ to s⁻¹; (b) estimate the age of the Universe in years. Give only the answer to (b), in units of 10¹⁰ years.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '1.397', '10¹⁰ years', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) H₀ = 70 × 10³ ÷ 3.09 × 10²² = 2.265 × 10⁻¹⁸ s⁻¹. (b) T = 1 ÷ 2.265 × 10⁻¹⁸ = 4.414 × 10¹⁷ s, which is 4.414 × 10¹⁷ ÷ 3.16 × 10⁷ = 1.40 × 10¹⁰ years. Mark scheme (6 marks). C1: unit conversion. C1: H₀ in s⁻¹. M1: T = 1/H₀. C1: s to years. C1: value. A1: T = 1.40 × 10¹⁰ years.', 6, NULL, NULL),
('aee58e78-9a51-5c73-b2be-f8395c7c35ff', '8695e833-9d29-4367-bfd6-0c20aebb2b1d', '397b2565-7a2c-5e16-a138-021d30b81dd9', 'a-level', '31.4', '9702 coursebook 31.4 · Hubble’s law and the Big Bang', 48, 48, 'Three galaxies have distances 2.0, 4.0 and 6.0 × 10²⁴ m and recession speeds 4.4, 9.0 and 13.6 × 10⁶ m s⁻¹. (a) Explain how a graph of v against d tests Hubble''s law. (b) Use the first and last galaxies to find H₀, in units of 10⁻¹⁸ s⁻¹.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '2.3', '10⁻¹⁸ s⁻¹', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) A straight line through the origin shows v ∝ d; its gradient is H₀. (b) H₀ = (13.6 × 10⁶ − 4.4 × 10⁶) ÷ (6.0 × 10²⁴ − 2.0 × 10²⁴) = 2.30 × 10⁻¹⁸ s⁻¹. Mark scheme (5 marks). B1: straight line through origin. M1: gradient. C1: substitution. C1: value. A1: H₀ = 2.30 × 10⁻¹⁸ s⁻¹.', 5, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fgf44776f7-t fgf44776f7-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fgf44776f7-t">Hubble graph data</title><desc id="fgf44776f7-d">Recession speed against distance for three galaxies: (2.0, 4.4), (4.0, 9.0) and (6.0, 13.6), with d in units of 10²⁴ m and v in units of 10⁶ m s⁻¹.</desc><line x1="29.4" y1="34" x2="29.4" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="79.8" y1="34" x2="79.8" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="130.2" y1="34" x2="130.2" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="180.5" y1="34" x2="180.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="230.9" y1="34" x2="230.9" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="281.3" y1="34" x2="281.3" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="331.6" y1="34" x2="331.6" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="382" y1="34" x2="382" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="242" x2="382" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="190" x2="382" y2="190" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="138" x2="382" y2="138" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="86" x2="382" y2="86" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="34" x2="382" y2="34" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="242" x2="388" y2="242" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="242" x2="29.4" y2="28" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="392,242 385.7,245 385.7,239" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><polygon points="29.4,24 32.4,30.3 26.5,30.3" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><line x1="29.4" y1="242" x2="29.4" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="29.4" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0</text><line x1="79.8" y1="242" x2="79.8" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="79.8" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">1</text><line x1="130.2" y1="242" x2="130.2" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="130.2" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">2</text><line x1="180.5" y1="242" x2="180.5" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="180.5" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">3</text><line x1="230.9" y1="242" x2="230.9" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="230.9" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">4</text><line x1="281.3" y1="242" x2="281.3" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="281.3" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">5</text><line x1="331.6" y1="242" x2="331.6" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="331.6" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">6</text><line x1="382" y1="242" x2="382" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="382" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">7</text><line x1="25.4" y1="242" x2="29.4" y2="242" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="22.4" y="242" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0</text><line x1="25.4" y1="190" x2="29.4" y2="190" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="22.4" y="190" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">4</text><line x1="25.4" y1="138" x2="29.4" y2="138" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="22.4" y="138" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">8</text><line x1="25.4" y1="86" x2="29.4" y2="86" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="22.4" y="86" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">12</text><line x1="25.4" y1="34" x2="29.4" y2="34" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="22.4" y="34" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">16</text><text x="205.7" y="274" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">distance d / 10²⁴ m</text><text x="25.4" y="14" font-size="14" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">recession speed v / 10⁶ m s⁻¹</text><line x1="126.2" y1="180.8" x2="134.2" y2="188.8" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="126.2" y1="188.8" x2="134.2" y2="180.8" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="226.9" y1="121" x2="234.9" y2="129" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="226.9" y1="129" x2="234.9" y2="121" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="327.6" y1="61.2" x2="335.6" y2="69.2" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="327.6" y1="69.2" x2="335.6" y2="61.2" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/></svg>', 'Recession speed against distance for three galaxies: (2.0, 4.4), (4.0, 9.0) and (6.0, 13.6), with d in units of 10²⁴ m and v in units of 10⁶ m s⁻¹.'),
('ddff2f05-9ca9-5bce-a79b-bfa26ea23bf6', '8695e833-9d29-4367-bfd6-0c20aebb2b1d', '397b2565-7a2c-5e16-a138-021d30b81dd9', 'a-level', '31.4', '9702 coursebook 31.4 · Hubble’s law and the Big Bang', 49, 49, 'A galaxy''s light shows a line at 518.0 nm whose laboratory wavelength is 486.1 nm. (a) Calculate Δλ/λ. (b) Calculate the recession speed in km s⁻¹. (c) Taking H₀ = 70 km s⁻¹ Mpc⁻¹, calculate the distance in Mpc. Give only the answer to (c). Take c = 3.00 × 10⁸ m s⁻¹.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '281.2', 'Mpc', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) Δλ/λ = (518.0 − 486.1) ÷ 486.1 = 0.06562. (b) v = 0.06562 × 3.00 × 10⁵ = 1.969 × 10⁴ km s⁻¹. (c) d = 1.969 × 10⁴ ÷ 70 = 281 Mpc. Mark scheme (6 marks). C1: Δλ/λ. C1: c in km s⁻¹. C1: v. M1: d = v/H₀. C1: value. A1: d = 281 Mpc.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 460 214" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg8e1eaf44-t fg8e1eaf44-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg8e1eaf44-t">Redshifted line</title><desc id="fg8e1eaf44-d">A line at 486.1 nm in the laboratory spectrum appears at 518.0 nm in the spectrum of a galaxy.</desc><rect x="104" y="34" width="332" height="32" rx="0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="94" y="50" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">laboratory</text><rect x="104" y="106" width="332" height="32" rx="0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="94" y="122" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">galaxy</text><line x1="212.3" y1="34" x2="212.3" y2="66" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.6;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="212.3" y="22" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="centra